{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202611aFcPslpq1795573225.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>高盛下調本港樓價升幅預測。</p><p></p><p>高盛原預期今年至2028年，本港樓價將分別上升一成半、百分之7及百分之3，但因為高利率及創富能力轉弱，下調樓價升幅預測至一成、百分之4及百分之3。</p><p></p><p>對於北部都會區，高盛認為是發展商的重大長遠發展機會，但發展商需要把投資期控制在7年以內，並達到最少兩成利潤率，才能取得合理回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.168783+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T02:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T08:57:19.780579+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:17.982739+00:00","content_hash":"b1e388e1bc4d50a1a8c5a03a73a37d65cafa4584be94aa1de2baed4fbc963716","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}